{"data": [{"author_id": "842092929040711681", "created_at": "2026-10-13T20:34:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110106910099952003"], "id": "2110106910099952003", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Request to @KPTrafficDept Please upload Parking point in Google maps, if it is possible! So its very easy to find Parking point through Google Map. Thank You For Maintaining Busy traffic with very Smoothly in huge Crowd in Durga Pujo! \nHappy Durga Pujo 🙏", "url": "https://x.com/SoumenB8013/status/2110106910099952003"}, {"author_id": "1695103118831407104", "created_at": "2026-10-13T20:12:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110101265636282832"], "id": "2110101265636282832", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "🚨 BREAKING: Kolkata is gearing up for Durga Puja 2026! With over 400 additional puja celebrations reported, police are strengthening security and crowd management across the city. 🥁🙏 #WestBengal #Kolkata #DurgaPuja2026", "url": "https://x.com/suddha123basak/status/2110101265636282832"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110095858767384576"]}, "author_id": "188335559", "created_at": "2026-10-13T19:50:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110095867340566831"], "id": "2110095867340566831", "in_reply_to_user_id": "188335559", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110095852798967900", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "অভিভাবকেরা কলকাতা পুলিশের আওতাধীন সমস্ত থানা ও ট্রাফিক গার্ড, হাওড়া ও শিয়ালদহ রেলওয়ে স্টেশন এবং কলকাতার সমস্ত মেট্রো স্টেশন থেকে এই ব্যাজ সংগ্রহ করতে পারবেন। https://t.co/IgsmNcrXlF", "url": "https://x.com/KPTrafficDept/status/2110095867340566831"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110095836558528512", "3_2110095844796166144"]}, "author_id": "188335559", "created_at": "2026-10-13T19:50:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110095852798967900"], "id": "2110095852798967900", "in_reply_to_user_id": "188335559", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110095831080816863", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "পুজোর ভিড়ে মণ্ডপ পরিদর্শনের সময় পরিবারের থেকে বিচ্ছিন্ন হয়ে পড়া পড়ুয়াদের দ্রুত শনাক্ত করে তাঁদের অভিভাবকদের কাছে ফিরিয়ে দেওয়াই এই বিশেষ উদ্যোগের মূল লক্ষ্য। https://t.co/f6lqFMqQ4E", "url": "https://x.com/KPTrafficDept/status/2110095852798967900"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110095814714593280", "3_2110095823883407360"]}, "author_id": "188335559", "created_at": "2026-10-13T19:50:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110095831080816863"], "id": "2110095831080816863", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 432, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "আসন্ন দুর্গাপুজোয় স্কুলপড়ুয়াদের নিরাপত্তা সুনিশ্চিত করতে গতকাল কলকাতা পুলিশের সদর দপ্তর লালবাজারে এক অনুষ্ঠানের মাধ্যমে বিশেষ পরিচয়পত্র বা আইডেন্টিটি ব্যাজ প্রকাশ করল কলকাতা পুলিশ। https://t.co/AvRdaFAlFr", "url": "https://x.com/KPTrafficDept/status/2110095831080816863"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110082312004374528"]}, "author_id": "1854467022861860864", "created_at": "2026-10-13T18:56:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110082324478275952"], "id": "2110082324478275952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 124, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Ek sawal jo kal raat se dimag se nikal nahi raha...\n\n​Durga Puja pandal ke bahar har koi khush tha.\n\nLights, music aur festive vibes.\n​Par crowd ke kone mein ye chhoti si bachhi thi...\n\nHaath mein colorful balloons liye par aankhon mein thakan.\n\n​Jahan bache naye kapdo me